#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:352
#, draft
msgid "Board recipes"
msgstr "Rezepter fir Jobbörsen"

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:354
#, draft
msgid ""
"For the boards that publish nothing a standard can read. A recipe records where one board puts each field; whatever it leaves empty is filled from the published standards."
msgstr ""
"Fir déi Jobbörsen, déi näischt verëffentlechen, wat e Standard liese kann. E Rezept hält fest, wou eng bestëmmte Börse all Feld hisetzt; wat se eidel léisst, gëtt aus de verëffentlechte Standarden ergänzt."

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:412
#, draft
msgid "Page metadata"
msgstr "Metadate vun der Säit"

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:300
#, draft
msgid ""
"Reads the JobPosting most large boards already publish about themselves, for search engines. A published standard the sites maintain, so it breaks far less often than guessing at their markup would."
msgstr ""
"Liest de JobPosting, deen déi meescht grouss Bourse souwisou iwwer sech selwer verëffentlechen, fir Sichmaschinnen. E verëffentlechte Standard, deen d'Säite selwer erhalen, also brécht en vill manner dacks, wéi wann een hire Markup géif roden."

#: src/postulo/plugins/builtin/__init__.py:414
#, draft
msgid ""
"The fallback, for a page with no structured data: the title it declares and its readable text. Deliberately unambitious — it saves typing and never pretends to know more than it does."
msgstr ""
"De Réckfall, fir eng Säit ouni strukturéiert Donnéeën: den Titel, deen se ugëtt, a säi liesbaren Text. Bewosst bescheiden — et spuert Tippen a mécht ni, wéi wann et méi wéisst, wéi et weess."
